2026-10-29T07:19:54.3678248Z == proving the checks can fail, one broken assertion at a time
2026-10-29T07:19:55.1912421Z   assert_eq that never fails: exits 1 at "assert_eq: unequal values panic"
2026-10-29T07:19:55.9699612Z   assert_eq without the line diff: exits 1 at "assert_eq: two texts of lines"
2026-10-29T07:19:56.7526324Z   assert_ne that never fails: exits 1 at "assert_ne: equal values panic"
2026-10-29T07:19:57.5351518Z   assert_nil that takes anything: exits 1 at "assert_nil: a value panics"
2026-10-29T07:19:58.3158744Z   assert_in_delta that always holds: exits 1 at "assert_in_delta: a distance past delta"
2026-10-29T07:19:59.1624078Z   assert_in_delta that takes a negative delta: exits 1 at "assert_in_delta: a negative distance"
2026-10-29T07:19:59.9423363Z   assert_includes that never fails: exits 1 at "assert_includes: a missing element"
2026-10-29T07:20:00.7033099Z   assert_error that hides what came: exits 1 at "assert_error: a value where an error was due"
2026-10-29T07:20:01.4584175Z   an error described without its message: exits 1 at "assert_error: an error of another type"
2026-10-29T07:20:02.2349864Z   assert_panics that sees no panic: exits 1 at "assert_panics: a panicking block passes it"
2026-10-29T07:20:03.0163528Z   assert_panics that ignores the words: exits 1 at "assert_panics: a panic with other words"
2026-10-29T07:20:03.6738744Z   a failure that names the library's line: site_check fails, "site: no line '  at .../site.iyi:4' in:"
2026-10-29T07:20:04.4986214Z   named cases that count no failure: cases_check fails, "cases: a program with a failed named case exited 0, not 1"
2026-10-29T07:20:05.1836285Z   a named case that ends the program: cases_check fails, "cases: no line 'ok - first' in:"
2026-10-29T07:20:05.8457490Z   named cases that exit 1 with none failed: passing_cases_check fails, "passing cases: every named case passed and the program exited 1"
2026-10-29T07:20:06.4893169Z   a summary when no case ran: no_cases_check fails, "no cases: a program with no named case printed a summary of them"
