2026-10-29T07:25:00.1338072Z 
2026-10-29T07:25:00.1338320Z Sockets: connect, accept, message exchange, short reads, closed peer,
2026-10-29T07:25:00.1338931Z refused connections, IPv6, unix sockets and timeouts all verified, a port and an address are checked before
2026-10-29T07:25:00.1339458Z they are packed, a closed socket says so, a socket waits on its thread's port wherever it last was,
2026-10-29T07:25:00.1339844Z and every check is proved to fail when broken.
